# ── agent / assistant tooling and internal notes ──────────────────────────
# None of this belongs in a public repo. Case-insensitive variants included
# because these files get created with whatever capitalisation the tool likes.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
claude.md
[Cc]laude*.md
AGENTS.md
[Aa]gents.md
GEMINI.md
[Gg]emini.md

# ...except this ONE. AGENTS.md is not assistant scratch: it is the written
# standard for how this site is built, reviewed the same way any other file
# here is, and the file every AI tool loads before it touches a line. Keeping
# it out would mean every new assistant re-deriving the house rules from
# scratch and getting them wrong, which is the exact cost the rest of this
# block was written to avoid. The rule it names still holds: private notes,
# handoffs and per-tool config stay out.
!/AGENTS.md
.claude/
.claude-*/
.codex/
.continue/
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.cursorignore
.aider*
.windsurfrules
.windsurf/
.roo/
.clinerules
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.specstory/
.sourcegraph/
mcp.json
.mcp.json
.devfleet/
.appmanifest.json

